{"id":"c5f2d99ce132fb68","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable.md","title":"Normality and Stability from an Adequate Enumeration","display":"prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable — Normality and Stability from an Adequate Enumeration","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable","aliases":["92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable"],"display":"prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable — Normality and Stability from an Adequate Enumeration","source":"第 XI 章 p. 128，Theorem 2A 后说明（PDF 145）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-abstract-enumeration-map]]","[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable — Normality and Stability from an Adequate Enumeration"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 128，Theorem 2A 后说明（PDF 145）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02e8de7bfb004da1\" href=\"?note=02e8de7bfb004da1\" title=\"92-df-abstract-enumeration-map\">92-df-abstract-enumeration-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd433626d0825ffc\" href=\"?note=bd433626d0825ffc\" title=\"92-df-normal-stable-system\">92-df-normal-stable-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:S\\times\\mathbb N\\to S\">\\(\\Phi:S\\times\\mathbb N\\to S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M,\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M,\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}\">\\(\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M,\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M,\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}\\)</span> 见枚举映射定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type1},\\mathrm{NormalSys},\\mathrm{StableSys},\\mathrm{ConSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{Type1},\\mathrm{NormalSys},\\mathrm{StableSys},\\mathrm{ConSys}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bd433626d0825ffc\" href=\"?note=bd433626d0825ffc\" title=\"92-df-normal-stable-system\">92-df-normal-stable-system</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}normal\\text{-}stable}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M(\\Phi)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NormalSys}(M),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M(\\Phi)\\land\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{StableSys}(M),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Type1}(M)\\land\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ConSys}(M).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}normal\\text{-}stable}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M(\\Phi)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NormalSys}(M),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M(\\Phi)\\land\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{StableSys}(M),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Type1}(M)\\land\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ConSys}(M).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一项：X∈P 时枚举条件给出某个 Φ(X,n)∈P，adequacy 给出 BX∈P。第二项：若 BX∈P 而 X∉P，枚举的负方向给出每个 ¬Φ(X,n)∈P，违背相对 ω 相容。第三项：若 f∈P，Type1 的爆炸重言式与 MP 给出全部 S 元素可证，特别是 Bf 与每个 ¬Φ(f,n)；再次违背相对 ω 相容。</p>\n<p>前两项分别使用实际列出的条件；不把 Normal 或 Stable 擅自加入枚举的定义。第三项是为原书 Theorem 2A 第二方向补明的经典逻辑步骤。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-abstract-enumeration-map","status":"resolved","id":"02e8de7bfb004da1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-enumeration-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-normal-stable-system","status":"resolved","id":"bd433626d0825ffc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-normal-stable-system","status":"resolved","id":"bd433626d0825ffc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M,\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M,\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}$ 见枚举映射定义；$\\mathrm{Type1},\\mathrm{NormalSys},\\mathrm{StableSys},\\mathrm{ConSys}$ 见 [[92-df-normal-stable-system]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:S\\times\\mathbb N\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M,\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M,\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type1},\\mathrm{NormalSys},\\mathrm{StableSys},\\mathrm{ConSys}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}normal\\text{-}stable}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M(\\Phi)&\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NormalSys}(M),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M(\\Phi)\\land\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}\n&\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{StableSys}(M),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Type1}(M)\\land\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}\n&\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ConSys}(M).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1814,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-truth-set]] → [[92-thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness]]；[[92-df-abstract-enumeration-map]] → [[92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable]] → [[92-thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness]]。这里的真固定点与可证固定点、Φ 枚举与外部 c.e. 枚举分别保留。"},{"id":"98b1207c207b95df","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-330","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable]]"}],"outgoing":["02e8de7bfb004da1","bd433626d0825ffc"]}